+## 1. Fresh ground truth (re-swept 11:20Z, independent of the auditor's 11:02-11:04Z window)
+
+`github_workflow_runs {"repo": "supremeai-core", "limit": 15}` (12 runs parsed, total_count 48):
+
+| run | branch | sha | event | conclusion | created_at (Z) | note |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 40 | main | feda45e | **schedule** | **failure** | 10-28 07:58:01 | the #2111 red; head = bot's own `ci` commit |
+| 39 | main | 832b27e | push | success | 10-27 16:53:58 | last green = sync(open→core) — matches #2111's "last green" |
+| 38 | main | 9408033 | push | success | 10-27 15:59:20 | sync lane green |
